#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "56_Akiyama"
msgid "(Huh?)"
msgstr "(¿Eh...?)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "80_Akiyama"
msgid "(What's with him? He better not be stalking my girls...)"
msgstr "(¿Y este tipo? Espero que no esté acosando a nuestras chicas...)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey! What are you doing?"
msgstr "¡Oi! ¿Qué crees que estás haciendo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "104_Shady Man"
msgid "Whoa!"
msgstr "¡Woah!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "116_Shady Man"
msgid "Uh, nothing!"
msgstr "¡Yo no, yo no hacía nada!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "You were sneaking a look at something."
msgstr "Pues, parece que estás escondido, mirando algo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "140_Shady Man"
msgid "Sneaking a look? No, I was just waiting for somebody."
msgstr "¿Mirando? Para nada, solo estaba esperando a alguien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "For who?"
msgstr "¿A quién?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "188_Shady Man"
msgid "Er－there she is!"
msgstr "¡Eh, a Miki-chan!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "224_Akiyama"
msgid "Who? You mean Miki?"
msgstr "¿Te refieres a la Miki de este lugar?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "236_Shady Man"
msgid "Oh, do you know her?"
msgstr "Eehh, ¿también conoces a Miki-chan?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. I own this place."
msgstr "Obvio. Soy el dueño de este club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "260_Shady Man"
msgid "Whaaa－!?"
msgstr "¡¿Quéééééé?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "And who might you be, hmm? A stalker, perhaps?"
msgstr "¿Y tú quién eres, mmm? ¿Su acosador, quizás?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "284_Shady Man"
msgid "No, no, nothing like that. I just wanted to see her..."
msgstr "No, no, claro que no. Solo quería verla..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "Are you one of her customers?"
msgstr "¿Eres uno de sus clientes?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "308_Shady Man"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "Sí..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Why not just go into the club, then?"
msgstr "¿Entonces por qué no entras al club y ya?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "332_Shady Man"
msgid "Well, the thing is..."
msgstr "Bueno, la cosa es que..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "356_Shady Man"
msgid "I've spent more than five million yen here over the past two\\r\nyears, and it looks like my money's finally run out..."
msgstr "Me he gastado más de cinco millones de yenes aquí en los últimos dos años, y creo que ya no me queda nada..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "368_Akiyama"
msgid "Five million yen!?"
msgstr "¡¿Cinco millones de yenes?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "380_Shady Man"
msgid "That's right. I was <Italic>this close</Italic> to winning her over, too..."
msgstr "Así es. Además, estuve <Italic>así de cerca</Italic> de conquistarla..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "If five million yen wasn't enough, I think it might be time to call it quits."
msgstr "Si cinco millones no fueron suficientes, creo que ya es hora de dejarlo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "404_Shady Man"
msgid "I just know I could do it if I had another million..."
msgstr "Estoy seguro de que sería capaz de conquistarla si tuviese otro millón..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "416_Akiyama"
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te llamas?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "428_Taniguchi"
msgid "Taniguchi."
msgstr "Taniguchi."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm Akiyama. In addition to this club, I also run a loan\\r\noffice called Sky Finance."
msgstr "Yo soy Akiyama. Además de este club, también manejo una empresa de préstamos llamada Sky Finance."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "452_Taniguchi"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Guau..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "464_Akiyama"
msgid "Look, the way things are now, you've got a snowball's chance\\r\nin hell of going out with Miki."
msgstr "Escúchame, por como van las cosas ahora, es más probable que un cerdo vuele a que salgas con Miki."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "476_Taniguchi"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "¿Ehh?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "488_Akiyama"
msgid "Even with another million yen, unless you make some changes,\\r\nyou could see her ten more times and still get absolutely\\r\nnowhere."
msgstr "Si no haces algunos cambios, no llegarías a ningún lado con ella, ni con otro millón de yenes ni viéndola diez veces más."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "500_Taniguchi"
msgid "Great..."
msgstr "Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "512_Akiyama"
msgid "Besides, you need more than just money to woo a woman.\\r\nFirst, you have to work on your look. Then comes building\\r\nup your own personal brand of charm."
msgstr "Además, hace falta más que solo dinero para conquistar una mujer. Primero, debes mejorar tu aspecto. Después, tienes que cultivar tu encanto personal."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "524_Taniguchi"
msgid "But how do I do all that?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿cómo hago todo eso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "536_Akiyama"
msgid "Meet me in front of the Millennium Tower later. I'll give you a\\r\nlittle advice."
msgstr "Encontrémonos en la entrada de la Torre Milennium más tarde. Te ayudaré con algunos consejos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "548_Taniguchi"
msgid "You'd do that for me?"
msgstr "¿Harías eso por mí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "560_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. Wouldn't be much of an owner if I didn't step in to\\r\nhelp such a loyal customer."
msgstr "Claro, claro. No puedo dejar a la deriva a un cliente que se gastó cinco millones de yenes en uno de mis locales."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "572_Taniguchi"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Muchas gracias."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, and the next time we meet, come all decked out in your\\r\nlady-killer best."
msgstr "Oh, y cuándo nos veamos, ven preparado con tu mejor outfit."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "596_Taniguchi"
msgid "Lady-killer?"
msgstr "¿Outfit?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "608_Akiyama"
msgid "You know, the clothes you'd wear if you had the chance to go\\r\nout on a date with Miki! I want to get a feel for your sense\\r\nof style."
msgstr "Ya sabes, ¡la ropa que usarías si tuvieras la oportunidad de salir a una cita con Miki! Quiero saber cuál es tu estilo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "620_Taniguchi"
msgid "Oh, er, okay... I will. I'll see you later, then. And thanks\\r\nagain."
msgstr "Oh, eh, está bien... Lo haré. Entonces te veo luego. Y gracias de nuevo."

